  "body": "Synchronize the personal Knoxx fork with exact accepted origin main `3409977bca4ba35e09967f9a99d50867a679a73c`, preserving fork main `b3903dfc4c9e9dd5e32ae658cf5d8abb88b8e792` through an ordinary merge. The verified comparison is zero fork-only and nine origin-only commits, from merged origin PRs382 and383.\n\nThe original five-file difference contains review/promotion workflow maintenance and appended provenance. All five synchronized artifacts matched exact source bytes before the separately identified owned receipt/reflection append. The incoming card records source/base revisions, scope, acceptance and the separate feature381 dependency. Application source is unchanged.\n\nLocal verification: source ancestry and fork/source historical ledger prefixes preserved; workflow YAML/receipt EDN parse; all three changed workflows pass actionlint; diff whitespace passes. No compiler, package installation, DB, PM2, service, live verifier, testing label, workflow dispatch, secret/settings/protection mutation, or deployment was executed. Historical origin reviews remain provenance and do not qualify this head.\n\nThe separate development replacement of origin PR381 will stack on this branch and preserve its exact original source `40221a69f7fff675b46614d9ab318b4ef52f3786`, with the original eight settled native threads linked individually. This PR does not import that feature.\n\n**Readiness hold:** inherited auto-merge attempts SQUASH on a ready same-repository PR before canonical exact-head qualification. This PR remains draft with auto-merge off until separately reviewed base enforcement is safe. No merge, origin release/deploy publication, or controller activation is implied. CodeRabbit's observed personal-account FairUsage reset `2026-10-06T15:01:50Z` is respected; manual requests are held while pending/cooldown remains.\n\nMigration infrastructure: yes\n\n<!-- pr-flow-stage:planning -->\n",
